What will be the final value of `count` after clicking a button that runs the following handler?
```js
const [count, setCount] = useState(0);
const handleClick = () => {
  setCount(count + 1);
  setCount(count + 1);
  setCount(count + 1);
};
```

What causes the 'stale closure' bug inside an effect with an empty dependency array (`[]`)?
```js
useEffect(() => {
  const id = setInterval(() => console.log(count), 1000);
  return () => clearInterval(id);
}, []);
```
